Description: calculator for Linux Mint and the Cinnamon desktop
 xl-Calculator is a calculator in the style of the Linux Mint X-Apps, with a
 classic menubar, the system theme and a history you can click to reuse
 earlier answers.
 .
 It has Basic, Scientific, Financial, Programmer, Unit Converter and
 Currency Converter modes, works to up to 50 decimal places, and can print
 its history like an adding-machine tape.
 .
 This program was called Xcalculator before version 0.10.
